# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD (/opt/start.sh) boots the vulnerable TeamCity auth-bypass
# sim on 0.0.0.0:8111 in the BACKGROUND and then execs `sleep infinity`, so the
# unauthenticated admin-token-generation surface
# (POST /app/rest/users/id:1/tokens/RPC2) is ALREADY REACHABLE when the agent
# starts, and PID 1 is the sleep.
#
# Consequence for solutions: the fix flips REQUIRE_AUTH_FOR_TOKENS to True in
# /opt/teamcity/app.py (or an equivalent auth fix) and RESTARTS the sim. A fix
# written but never restarted leaves the running process on the old vulnerable
# code — still exploitable.
